			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Switch Enhanced IPC to legacy Tauri server types\n\nUpdate the `EnhancedIPCManager` integration logic in `Source/IPC/Enhanced/mod.rs` to reference the legacy `TauriIPCServer_Old` module instead of the current `TauriIPCServer` implementation.\n\nThis change aligns the enhanced message handler and server integration functions with the older IPC architecture by modifying the `integrate_with_tauri_ipc` method signature and the `create_enhanced_handler` closure to accept `TauriIPCServer_Old::TauriIPCMessage`. This ensures compatibility with the existing legacy server instance while the new server implementation is stabilized.\n\nNo functional behavior is altered; the scope is limited to type path redirection for IPC message handling.",
